  "notes": "Cash basis, governmental only (no business-type funds). Beginning/ending cash = cash basis fund balances (p4); ending 12,065,744 = cash 682,312 + investments 11,383,432 (p3), investments not reported separately in the roll-forward. Statement Taxes 5,080,400 split by fund name (Inheritance Fund; Visitors Promotion and Visitors Improvement funds) with the rest unlabeled (Statement of Activities prints only 'Taxes'). Statement Miscellaneous 617,378 split using the Statement of Activities general receipts (Sale of Real Property 491,882 + Miscellaneous 125,496). Public Works mapped to streets/highways (mostly Road/Special Road funds; includes surveyor and noxious weed). Balance sheet from the governmental funds statement (totals equal the government-wide statement). Detail: General Fund budget schedule (departments, no object breakdown), major fund budget schedules (single disbursement lines; Ag Society Building Fund disbursements split into principal/interest from its p4 column), nonmajor funds (19 funds) from the combining statement Total Nonmajor Funds column; the one-line nonmajor budget schedules (pp10-14) are not recorded to avoid double counting. Read pages 1-18 of 18 Balances are the printed \"Cash basis fund balances - beginning / ending\" rows, recorded as fund balance like this county's other years (2026-11-19)."
}
